## Proposed Features & Assignment Alignment

### Core 3D Scene & Staging
- **React Three Fiber Canvas:** Fully hardware-accelerated WebGL viewport rendered inside Next.js using `@react-three/fiber` and `@react-three/drei`.
- **Procedural Architectural Geometry:** A multi-tiered modular building (Ground Lobby, Commercial Office Levels, Residential Suites, and Penthouse) built with native Three.js primitives for zero asset-download latency.
- **Environment & Staged Lighting:** Directional key light, soft ambient fill, contact shadows, and an environment map with a toggleable Day/Night lighting cycle.
- **Camera Rig & Orbit Controls:** Smooth orbit, pan, and pinch-to-zoom controls configured with polar angle limits (preventing the camera from dipping below the floor grid).

### Meaningful Interactions (Beyond Orbiting)
- **Interactive Tier Selection (Floor Exploder):** Clicking or tapping any floor smoothly animates it upward along the Y-axis using spring physics (via `framer-motion-3d` or `@react-spring/three`), isolating the selected level.
- **Contextual Floor Metadata HUD:** An overlay HUD card displaying real-time floor metrics (e.g., Square Footage, Occupancy Type, Pricing, and Lead Compatibility) based on the selected tier.
- **Material & Style Configurator:** A HUD control panel (`leva`) to switch between three real estate architectural finishes (Modern Slate, Emerald Eco, Obsidian High-Tech), toggle Wireframe mode, and play/pause auto-rotation.

### Performance, A11y & Responsible Loading
- **Client-Only Lazy Loading:** Dynamic import (`next/dynamic` with `ssr: false`) ensuring the 3D bundle does not bloat initial server-side hydration.
- **Skeleton / Static Fallback:** A styled CSS isometric building card rendered while WebGL initializes.
- **Reduced-Motion Support:** Detects `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` to automatically disable camera animations, floor explosion physics, and auto-rotation.
- **Mobile-Optimized Touch Handling:** Touch-action CSS optimizations preventing page-scroll conflicts during orbit gestures.

### Capstone Integration
- **Direct Navigation Link:** Embedded in the main dashboard header, allowing reviewers to jump seamlessly between the AI Lead Chat and the 3D Property Viewer.
- **Performance Budget Documentation:** Concrete metrics detailing bundle impact, draw call counts, geometry size optimizations, and future enhancements added to `README.md`.

